Changelog
All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

The format is based on Keep a Changelog,
and this project adheres to Semantic Versioning.

[2.0.0] - 2026-06-06 (Assignment Part 2)
Added
New custom stylesheets in the CSS/ directory (style.css) to handle advanced layout structures.

Integration of visual assets and graphics in the IMAGES/ directory, including infographics (Car-infographic.jpg).

Enhanced responsive design rules to improve viewing across mobile and desktop screens.

Changed
Refactored structural HTML/CSS hierarchy for better accessibility and readability.

Updated layout sections to meet specific project requirements for Assignment Part 2.

Fixed
Resolved minor alignment and padding issues on smaller viewports.

[1.0.0] - 2026-05-01 (Assignment Part 1)
Added
Initial repository setup and directory structure (CSS/, IMAGES/).

Basic HTML markup and foundational styling.